 "title": {
  "en": "90A Telok Blangah Street 31"
 },
 "description": "Interior-led. Pride-forward. Premium justified.\nThis is not a home that was renovated. \n\nIt is a home that was crafted — by owners who researched every material, chose every finish deliberately, and never once settled for ordinary.\n\nLIVING & COMMON AREAS\n\nLarge-format Spanish imported tiles — seamlessly flowing from living area into master bedroom, laid with precision and maintained immaculately\n\nPhilips Hue Smart Lighting — full ambiance control by app or voice\n\nSignature bespoke indoor garden trellis platform — custom-built with 3 deep drawers, full-height shelving & integrated projector pull-out tray. A statement piece that transforms the living room entirely\n\nKITCHEN\nFENIX NTM Italian laminate — the same premium material found in European luxury kitchens. Celebrated for its extraordinary matte depth and self-healing surface\n\nBuilt-in wine chiller seamlessly integrated into entertainer's island\n\nPremium under-mount stainless steel sink\nOversized yard with dual-sided full-height cabinetry — engineered for serious living\n\nMASTER SUITE\n\nCustom recessed rounded King-size bedframe — purposefully lowered to create an architectural sense of grandeur and ceiling height\n\nFive-door full-length built-in wardrobe — dedicated long dress compartments, drawers & accessory organizers\n\nTotal blackout blinds & curtains — a true personal retreat\n\nCREATIVE STUDIO\n\nDedicated room — music, work, art or sanctuary\n\nAngled Hafary glazed porcelain tiles — boutique studio warmth\n\nCustom floating desk with integrated drawers, monitor shelf & heavy-duty 88-key piano pull-out tray\n\nTHE OWNERSHIP STANDARD\n\nMeticulously maintained — every surface reflects genuine pride of ownership\n\nBrand new neighboring units — freshly settled, peaceful & undisturbed\n\nMove-in ready — collect keys and begin living beautifully immediately\n\nMatching spare Spanish tiles retained for BR3 reinstatement",
