     "jobTitle": "Associate Group Director",
     "description": "My accreditation and awards : https://propertyagentsrating.com/profile/R051495D\r\n\r\nSteven Liew is an accomplished Propnex Real Estate Salesperson who brings a strategic yet personable approach to the home buying and home selling process. \r\n\r\nDrawing from years of experience as a Real Estate Salesperson, Steven has built a reputation for his refreshingly friendly customer care and proven ability to guide buyers to obtain the best value for their dream home and to assist sellers to a smooth, stress-free sale of their home.\r\n\r\nA Singaporean native, Steven has extensive knowledge of the different towns and neighborhoods across Singapore. He serves the entire Singapore area and specializes in home buying and selling, investment properties, luxury homes, and multi-residential properties. Steven obtained a Bachelor’s Degree in Information Systems from the National University of Singapore. He joined Largest Property Agency Propnex Realty Pte Ltd under the largest division Powerful Negotiators with at least 2600 agents. He received comprehensive training and guidance from the Veterans in Real Estates Industry and he has transacted more than $10 million worth of properties in Singapore. He has becoming an expert in current financial options, local and national markets, and the subtle art of negotiating property purchases. Now he brings his passion and sharp attention to detail to help buyers in a highly focused search for their new house and to help sellers get the most value for their home.\r\n\r\nAs an experienced agent, Steven understands that buying and selling is one of the biggest decisions in a client’s life and views representation and guidance of his clients through this process as a true privilege.",
